{"work_id": "MX3-009", "matched_key": "一个极其重要的政策", "normalized_offset": 0, "normalized_context": "一个极其重要的政策一九四二年九月七日中文马克思主义文库毛泽东一个极其重要的政策一九四二年九月七日这是毛泽东为延安解放日报写的社论自从党中央提出精兵简政1这个政策以来许多抗日根据地的党都依照中央的指示筹划和进行了这项工作晋冀鲁豫边区的领导同志对这项工作抓得很紧做出了精兵简政的模范例子但是还有若干根据地的同志们因为认识不够没有认真地进行这些地方的同志们还不理解精兵简政同当前形势和党的各项政策的关系还没有把精兵简政当作一个极其重要的政策看待关于这件事解放日报曾多次讨论今愿更有所说", "cue_words": [], "title_form_signal": "near_page_heading", "witness_id": "A-363da93a71f02b846b2b", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/marxist.org-chinese-mao-19420907.htm", "raw_sha256": "8d83a0c424d56aab336f95a9b9842db2a00a188163c4d210a8cefa0c575dcb72", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "maoxuan-mia-catalogue", "volume": 3, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "kind": "web_lines", "number": 1, "end": 28, "record_path": "archive/records/A-363da93a71f02b846b2b.json", "text_path": "archive/text/A-363da93a71f02b846b2b.txt", "source_title": "一个极其重要的政策", "source_media": "html", "source_layer": "web_transcription", "edition_verification_status": "not_independently_verified", "public_url_rechecked_this_run": false, "family": "maoxuan", "id": "C-a1f60929fd1325cb", "status": "candidate_only_not_work_identity_revision_or_causation", "normalization": "NFKC plus letters/digits only; context is NOT a verbatim quote"}
{"work_id": "MX3-009", "matched_key": "一个极其重要的政策", "normalized_offset": 0, "normalized_context": "一个极其重要的政策一九四二年九月七日自从党中央提出精兵简政1这个政策以来许多抗日根据地的党都依照中央的指示筹划和进行了这项工作晋冀鲁豫边区的领导同志对这项工作抓得很紧做出了精兵简政的模范例子但是还有若干根据地的同志们因为认识不够没有认真地进行这些地方的同志们还不理解精兵简政同当前形势和党的各项政策的关系还没有把精兵简政当作一个极其重要的政策看待关于这件事解放日报曾多次讨论今愿更有所说明党的一切政策都是为着战胜日寇而第五年以后的抗战形势实处于争取胜利的最后阶段这个阶段不但和抗", "cue_words": [], "title_form_signal": "near_page_heading", "witness_id": "A-6f3c97f39a890c27616d", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E9%80%89%E9%9B%86/%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E9%80%89%E9%9B%86.pdf", "raw_sha256": "e65195a022c0a066d8bbcf68fcf452a764f7f759019331cf153dadd16233d242", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "maoxuan-mirror-combined-unverified", "volume": null, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "kind": "pdf_page", "number": 720, "end": 720, "record_path": "archive/records/A-6f3c97f39a890c27616d.json", "text_path": "archive/text/A-6f3c97f39a890c27616d.txt", "source_title": "毛泽东选集", "source_media": "pdf", "source_layer": "digital_PDF_copy", "edition_verification_status": "source_bytes_verified_imprint_images_available_for_review", "public_url_rechecked_this_run": false, "family": "maoxuan", "id": "C-116f6dca6f00f2e5", "status": "candidate_only_not_work_identity_revision_or_causation", "normalization": "NFKC plus letters/digits only; context is NOT a verbatim quote"}
